h this, you must unravel the secrets of Ragnarok and confront the jotun giants and their minions.</strong>.<br><br><strong>HISTORY</strong>.<br>Make your way through the torment awaiting in the worlds, passing all of Loki's tests and killing all of the giants, time after time making your way through the gaps despite the dire consequences.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446440/extras/4fa1602991729a5b96c0115f523d8fd8.poster.avif?t=1699463345\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446440/extras/4fa1602991729a5b96c0115f523d8fd8.webm?t=1699463345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446440/extras/4fa1602991729a5b96c0115f523d8fd8.mp4?t=1699463345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Embark on a journey through stunning Scandinavian landscapes where hallucinations blur the line between reality and nightmare. Armed with detective skills and a powerful arsenal, you'll battle grotesque monsters and discover the truth behind your wife's murder and the search for your son.<br><br><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong>.<br>Use the gun given by your wife and your detective skills to survive encounters with giants.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446440/extras/954fccc2189301a33b616af6c9d8cf4c.poster.avif?t=1699463345\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446440/extras/954fccc2189301a33b616af6c9d8cf4c.webm?t=1699463345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446440/extras/954fccc2189301a33b616af6c9d8cf4c.mp4?t=1699463345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Decide